(1. Project Overview) Tj
0 -14 Td
(EventHub is a full-stack event platform with role-based access:) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- Public pages: home, register, login.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- User dashboard: browse events, register, tickets, bookings, calendar, profile, support.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- Organizer dashboard: organizer home with managed-event insights.) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(Core backend is implemented in Python \(standard library HTTP server\) and stores data in MySQL.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Frontend is plain HTML/CSS/JavaScript and consumes backend JSON APIs using fetch\(\).) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
