(3.3 Session and auth flow) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- After successful login, a random token is generated via secrets.token_urlsafe\(32\).) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- Token is stored in SESSIONS with user identity and role.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- Cookie session_id is returned with HttpOnly and SameSite=Lax.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- Protected handlers call current_user\(\)/require_session\(\) and enforce role checks.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- Role gating:) Tj
0 -14 Td
(  - organizer endpoint/page access requires role == organizer) Tj
0 -14 Td
(  - user endpoints require role == user) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
